{"id": "70072", "title": "白莲花，滚粗！", "author": "九紫", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 39, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/70/70072/70072s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/70/70072.htm", "intro": "有一种你无法理解的神奇生物：\r\n    她有一双如雾如梦的眼睛，如屎一般的浪漫情怀。\r\n    小强一样打不死的精神，杂草一样令人忧伤的命格，\r\n    周围只要是雄性生物都会爱上她，没爱上她的一定是恶毒的男配女配，\r\n    总能在“无意”间将她对立面的人弄的生不如死，凄惨无比。\r\n    不幸的是，苏瑾就没爱上她。幸运的是，苏瑾决定送她去死。</FONT>\r\n    问：世人骗我，谤我，欺我，害我，何以处之？\r\n    答：你便轻她，贱她，辱她，蔑她，看准时机弄死她！\r\n   《白莲花，滚粗》这篇文报名参加了鼓励创新奖，喜欢这篇文的妹子去给小九投个票吧~", "base": "files/article/html/70/70072", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "第 1 章", "file": "10821003.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 2 章", "file": "10821004.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 3 章", "file": "10821005.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 4 章", "file": "10821006.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 5 章", "file": "10821007.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 6 章", "file": "10821008.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 7 章", "file": "10821009.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 8 章", "file": "10821010.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 9 章", "file": "10821011.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 10 章", "file": "10821012.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 11 章", "file": "10821013.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 12 章", "file": "10821014.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 13 章", "file": "10821015.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 14 章", "file": "10821016.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 15 章", "file": "10821017.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 16 章", "file": "10821018.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 17 章", "file": "10821019.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 19 章", "file": "10821020.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 20 章", "file": "10821021.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 21 章", "file": "10821022.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第 22 章", "file": "10821023.html", "available": false}, {"title": "